  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can spend 10 minutes pondering on a single memory that has transpired within the last day, allowing you to analyze any relevant targets within the chosen memory. A single memory can span up to 1 minute per rank in the associated skill, but otherwise is only limited to what you can perceive. All targets that you analyze are treated as if they were also scrutinized; if you possess any abilities or talents that allow you to augment the scrutinize approach, you may pay any costs associated with it when pondering a memory to benefit from it.</p>\n<p>You cannot retry the same check more than once, nor can you use senses or similar ability you did not possess during the memory.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
